<%= email_greeting(@user) %>,

the review of your employment reference "<%= @title %>" is finished.
<%= if @grade do %>
Overall grade: <%= @grade %>
<% end %>
Only you can see the result. You can read it here:

<%= @url %>settings/job_references/<%= @reference_id %>/check

The reading was produced by a language model on our own servers and is not
legal advice. For a binding assessment please ask a lawyer, ideally one
specialising in employment law.

You can turn these notification emails off here:

<%= @unsubscribe_url %>

<%= render "_signature_en.text" %>

<%= render "_footer.text" %>
